<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>Opto-Hot · 激光</title><link>https://opto-hot-a455-d3g2s3dt865d86640.webapps.tcloudbase.com/#/all</link><description>激光</description><lastBuildDate>2026-10-11T10:50:55.414143+00:00</lastBuildDate><item><title>频准激光上半年营收2.56亿元增42.13% 净利润增24.58%</title><link>https://www.c114.com.cn/news/123/a1316461.html</link><description>C114讯 8月27日消息（颜翊）昨日，本月18日刚刚上市的量子科技公司频准激光披露首份半年度业绩报告，2026年上半年，公司实现营业收入2.56亿元，同比增长42.13%；实现归母净利润8833.57万元，同比增长24.58%。</description><guid isPermaLink="false">f1f6e3bfdfe0</guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T10:50:55.414143+00:00</pubDate><source>C114中国通信网_通信财经</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>8月激光雷达 | 禾赛华为只差65颗，52.5万颗车载激光雷达后第二曲线浮出水面</title><link>https://laser.ofweek.com/2026-09/ART-240001-12003-30705420.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">b264224fa0c1</guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T10:50:55.414143+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 激光频道</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>自动驾驶激光雷达应如何进行标定？</title><link>https://laser.ofweek.com/2026-04/ART-240002-8140-30685436.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">92293ea8ffe6</guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T10:50:55.414143+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 激光频道</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>自动驾驶中激光雷达搭载越多融合越困难吗？</title><link>https://laser.ofweek.com/2026-04/ART-240002-8140-30685550.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">cb1caad6b2bb</guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T10:50:55.414143+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 激光频道</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>自动驾驶激光雷达无法识别反光背心吗？</title><link>https://laser.ofweek.com/2026-04/ART-240002-8140-30684861.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">a7b2828ec846</guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T10:50:55.414143+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 激光频道</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>自动驾驶激光雷达中的角分辨率决定了什么？</title><link>https://laser.ofweek.com/2026-04/ART-240015-8140-30684289.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">6d5041039a3c</guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T10:50:55.414143+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 激光频道</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>高线束激光雷达对自动驾驶的能力有何提升？</title><link>https://laser.ofweek.com/2026-03/ART-8140-2400-30683964.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">e7626f549537</guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T10:50:55.414143+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 激光频道</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>Ultraviolet laser pulses engineer diamond defects selectively, leaving quantum qubits intact</title><link>https://phys.org/news/2026-10-ultraviolet-laser-pulses-diamond-defects.html</link><description>When we think about a diamond, we often think about a material whose value comes from its perfection. In my research, however, I am interested in something almost opposite: the tiny imperfections inside diamonds. These atomic-scale defects can give diamonds new optical and electronic properties, and some of them can serve as quantum systems. The challenge is learning how to control these defects without disturbing the others.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">e1f4243c1ce7</guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T10:50:55.414143+00:00</pubDate><source>Phys.org 物理新闻</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>Ultrashort laser pulses let new microscope map electron interactions across thin materials</title><link>https://phys.org/news/2026-10-ultrashort-laser-pulses-microscope-electron.html</link><description>A new type of advanced microscope (wide-field coherent multidimensional microscopy) has been developed. It uses a carefully designed sequence of ultrashort light pulses to study the behavior of high-tech materials, with potential practical applications in the study of innovative materials such as those used to build solar panels. This is the result of work by a research group of physicists from the Faculty of Sciences, Mathematics, Physics, and Natural Sciences at Università Cattolica's Brescia </description><guid isPermaLink="false">1c8b047260ce</guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T10:50:55.414143+00:00</pubDate><source>Phys.org 物理新闻</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>X-ray technique reveals how quantum materials respond to laser pulses in real time</title><link>https://phys.org/news/2026-10-ray-technique-reveals-quantum-materials.html</link><description>Creating a quantum device often begins by intentionally damaging a crystal. Scientists fire an ultrafast laser pulse into a material, knocking atoms out of place and leaving behind tiny imperfections called vacancies. Far from being flaws, these vacancies can behave as qubits—the fundamental building blocks of quantum information.</description><guid isPermaLink="false">dc11780b29e9</guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T10:50:55.414143+00:00</pubDate><source>Phys.org 物理新闻</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>液冷板激光焊接，智启AI算力“散热革命”新引擎</title><link>https://laser.ofweek.com/2026-09/ART-8200-2400-30703863.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">591a5abf3b3e</guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T10:50:55.414143+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 激光频道</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>打造“冷静”的 AI 算力中心：激光焊接检测助力液冷散热高质量制造</title><link>https://laser.ofweek.com/2026-06/ART-240015-8230-30689718.html</link><description></description><guid isPermaLink="false">8c2f50ef6fe4</guid><pubDate>2026-10-11T10:50:55.414143+00:00</pubDate><source>OFweek 激光频道</source><category>激光</category></item><item><title>10万块买带激光雷达的车?是真的,但别接着下单</title><link>https://weixin.sogou.com/link?url=dn9a_-gY295K0Rci_xozVXfdMkSQTLW6cwJThYulHEtVjXrGTiVgS-7uIR8pB8z1zNuYEmDicEyQAlERjKSUU1qXa8Fplpd9tlxuPdShth8OBfV1DhMPAGnpFjLx_8In-xHerCxMVvW7WamqW3Uhcb4jhWSvBAnDPGPKTe84S4a31JVsQqbJo5VOALS8NbttfQsK2LpeNtnwkXjnGQAZ_y1dOIqS4YSLxv8wOFiLELpKd2O2oodM8m3XC_rWwmiaCSmpERfcvdDyPfCoem7FzA..&amp;amp;type=2&amp;amp;query=%E6%BF%80%E5%85%89%E9%9B%B7%E8%BE%BE&amp;amp;token=FBB504DA85F944F2E6E0BB68BF883455E6CC1F706ACB6A08</link><description>极狐T7、吉利星瑞L PLUS、长安启源Q06——激光雷达下探至11万级.但＂有